<title>SINGAPORE: Toshiba Chemical opens Singapore plant.</title>
<headline>Toshiba Chemical opens Singapore plant.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Toshiba Chemical Corp opened a Singapore $57 million chemical plant here on Thursday, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The plant, which produces epoxy moulding compounds, insulating varnishes and casting resins used in electronics, started operations in March.</p>
<p>Toshiba has 16 companies in Singapore and expects sales in 1997 of Singapore $20 million, rising to $60 million by 2000, the statement said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (65 8703081)</p>
